<div class="archive-page">
<h1>Archive</h1>
{% set first = collections.bulletins | last %}
<p class="archive-note">One edition each morning since {{ first.date | readableDate }}. Days without an edition are marked in the list. Dates in an edition apply to that morning. This is a dated briefing, not a live alert.</p>
<section id="guides" aria-labelledby="guides-title">
  <h2 id="guides-title">Keep these close</h2>
  <ul class="guide-list">
    <li><a href="/zilker-park-access/">Zilker entrances, closures & parking</a></li>
    <li><a href="/vote-2026/">Vote 2026: dates & official instructions</a></li>
    <li><a href="https://yallcityhall.org/meetings/2026-11-05/">City Council on November 5</a></li>
    <li><a href="/election/2026-11-03/">November 3, 2026 election results</a></li>
    <li><a href="/austin-council-races-2026/">The five Council races on the 2026 ballot</a></li>
    <li><a href="/austin-bonds-2026/">Propositions A and B: the parks and library bonds</a></li>
    <li><a href="/austin-charter-2026/">Propositions C through J: the charter amendments</a></li>
    <li><a href="/austin-city-budget-2027/">The 2026-27 city budget and what it costs you</a></li>
    <li><a href="/aisd-state-intervention/">Austin ISD and the state: what happens next</a></li>
    <li><a href="/muny-2026/">The Muny deal: Austin, UT and Lions Municipal</a></li>
    <li><a href="/feed.xml">Follow the morning editions by RSS</a></li>
  </ul>
</section>
<link href="{{ '/pagefind/pagefind-ui.css' | url }}" rel="stylesheet">
<script src="{{ '/pagefind/pagefind-ui.js' | url }}"></script>
<div id="search"></div>
<script>
  document.addEventListener("DOMContentLoaded", () => {
    new PagefindUI({ element: "#search", showSubResults: true, showImages: false });
  });
</script>
<ul class="archive-list">
{% for b in collections.bulletins %}
  {% set older = collections.bulletins[loop.index] %}
  {% set headline = b.inputPath | archiveTitle %}
  <li><a href="{{ b.url }}">
    <time class="archive-date" datetime="{{ b.fileSlug }}">{{ b.date | archiveDate }}</time>
    {%- if headline %}<span class="archive-headline">{{ headline }}</span>{% endif %}
  </a></li>
  {%- if older %}{% set gap = b.date | editionGap(older.date) %}
  {%- if gap %}
  <li class="archive-gap">No edition {{ gap }}.</li>
  {%- endif %}{% endif %}
{% endfor %}
</ul>
</div>
